==========================================================================
0. DICTIONARY (doc -> FJ)
==========================================================================
  FJ mostly-plus: L_EA = -c1 (DA)^2_{aa} - c2 (D.A)^2 - c3 (DA)^2_{cross} + c4 a.a
  doc writes     : + c2_doc (D.A)^2 + c4_doc a.a
  => c2_FJ = -c2_doc , c4_FJ = +c4_doc ; c1 = -c3 = K_B from -(K_B/2)F^2 (part-1 tie-in)
  [FLAG] THE_GENERALIZED_COMPLETION.md must either flip the sign of its c2 term or
         define c2 through this map; its gate-7 formula c_S^2=c2(2-c14)/(c14(2+3c2)) is
         the FJ-c2 formula, so as written the doc mixes conventions.

